. *----------------------------------------------------------------- sorted
. sysuse auto, clear
(1978 automobile data)

. keep make price mpg foreign rep78

. sort foreign price

. label data "sorted subset of auto"

. save "sorted.dta", replace
(file sorted.dta not found)
file sorted.dta saved

. describe

